00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:04.760
- Disagree.

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:05.896
- Disagree.

00:14:05.896 --> 00:14:07.150
- Disagree.

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:08.070
- Disagree.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:09.363
