00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:20.100
My blindness is yes, just a piece of me,

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:21.360
but it is a large piece of me,

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:23.930
and it's a large piece that has informed

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:25.510
many of the other pieces of me.

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:27.440
So call me blind, 'cause I am.

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:29.160
Call me short, 'cause I am.

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:30.820
Call me pale, 'cause I am.

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:34.860
These are just facts about
me and they don't offend me.

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:36.170
They don't upset me.

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:37.680
They are things that I'm proud of,

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.440
and that I wholeheartedly own.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.470
I do call myself the blind cook.

00:14:41.470 --> 00:14:45.050
People do know me as the blind
