00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:57.360
and then people say
like, oh, she's a chef.

00:14:57.360 --> 00:15:00.170
Oh, but she's also blind,
isn't that even more amazing?

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:02.470
I don't want to be put
on this other pedestal

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:03.960
in spite of my vision loss.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:05.950
- Yeah. it's interesting because

00:15:05.950 --> 00:15:08.310
I'm with Christine that
where it's a disagree.

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:12.130
I do love it, that in the bio,

00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:14.160
blindness is the last thing on the list.

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:16.070
I'm, you know, Mario Bonds,

00:15:16.070 --> 00:15:18.430
32 year old singer
songwriter from Maryland.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:20.790
And then you can add, he lost his sight

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:23.300
to Morning Glory syndrome
and blah, blah, blah.

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:24.840
It's done in a respectable way.

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:27.120
- I didn't say strongly disagree because

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:29.210
I think being diagnosed at 21,

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:32.280
a lot of who I am was still
being a sighted person,

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:34.210
up until 21, and because of that,

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:35.370
I have to honor that.

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:38.500
- It's really important that
we're all that out there,

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:42.310
shouting about the blind
message that we're united,

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:45.600
and we're owning it because for ages,

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:47.590
I didn't want to be blind.

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:51.690
I went blind at 17 and
I didn't like the word.

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:54.340
I lost my vision and I
don't know what to do.

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:57.990
And I'm grieving and there's
a loss there and you know,

00:15:57.990 --> 00:16:00.870
what are these connotations
of this word blind?

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:02.177
It's scary, you know?

00:16:02.177 --> 00:16:03.770
And I was that girl at school

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:05.360
that didn't want to use her cane,

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:07.620
and didn't want to own it
because there is still a lot of

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:12.040
people out there that see the
tagline blind and go. ooh.

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:14.410
And you know, it got a lot easier

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:16.970
